  "pack_markdown": "# Pocket Ecosystem Smuggler — Interaction Wireframe Pack v0.3\nFun promise: 작은 가방 안의 먹이사슬을 예측·개입하면서 동시에 검문 흔적을 관리하는 압축된 생태 전략.\n\nFlow: Run Setup → Suitcase Ecosystem → Checkpoint → Segment Result → next segment/restored retry → Run Result. Pause preserves state. Core play keeps the 3x3 suitcase dominant, exposes deterministic resolution and next-tick prediction, and makes checkpoint concealment a direct reading of the same ecosystem. Invalid input is non-destructive; failures restore the segment-start snapshot. Implementation architecture is intentionally deferred to Blueprint.",
  "source_run_at": "2026-09-30T16:33:45.299429+00:00",
  "target_device": "mobile",
  "global_ui_rules": {
    "rules": [
      "3x3 bag is primary focus",
      "HUD exposes segment/tick, food and trace",
      "danger uses icon plus value",
